idth": 480, "preference": -7, "id": "34", "resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/oRUdc6xwXnc/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oRUdc6xwXnc/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "36", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/oRUdc6xwXnc/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "37"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oRUdc6xwXnc/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "38"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/oRUdc6xwXnc/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oRUdc6xwXnc/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "40", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/oRUdc6xwXnc/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oRUdc6xwXnc/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "From Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films using CGI, VFX and AI, powered by high-end GPU Computers. Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for YouTube, Meta, TV, OTT & more\n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\nWe create cinematic backdrops on which our VFX team later composites your product or models created by our inhouse AI powered VFX experts. But here’s the key — The real production happens inside our proprietary content infrastructure, having high-end systems and GPUs with special AI integrated software, which we use to create accurate 3D product models, controlled environments, lighting, motion, and final polish without shooting even once.\n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 117, "view_count": 667, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oRUdc6xwXnc", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["AI ad film", "AI commercial", "AI generated video", "AI video production", "generative AI advertising", "CGI commercial", "CGI ad film", "VFX commercial", "VFX ad film", "virtual production ad", "no shoot advertisement", "virtual ad film", "digital advertising", "future of advertising", "AI marketing video", "brand film", "product ad video", "3D commer